@startuml 01-cart-order-activity
' SRS 2.1 Online Ordering - UC10 Manage Cart, UC11 Place Online Order, UC12/13 Payment
title Add to Cart and Place Online Order

|Customer|
start
:View Menu / Product Detail (UC07, UC09);
:Choose size, sugar, ice, toppings and quantity;
:Click "Add to cart";

|System|
if (Product available (is_available) and size/toppings valid?) then (yes)
  if (Cart already has item with same options?) then (yes)
    :Increase quantity;
  else (no)
    :Add new cart line;
  endif
  :Recalculate unit price = base price + size surcharge + toppings\nLine total = unit price x quantity (BR-08);
  :Update cart item badge;
else (no)
  :Show "Item sold out / invalid options";
  stop
endif

|Customer|
:View cart: edit quantity (>= 1), change options, remove items;
:Click "Checkout";

|System|
if (Logged in?) then (no)
  :Open login popup, keep cart;
  |Customer|
  :Log in (UC02);
  |System|
endif

|Customer|
:Choose fulfillment: Delivery / Pickup / Dine-in;
:Enter recipient name + phone;
if (Fulfillment?) then (Delivery)
  :Select district (inner Hanoi), enter ward,\naddress detail; time: ASAP or scheduled today;
elseif () then (Pickup)
  :Pickup time: ASAP or scheduled today;
else (Dine-in)
  :Enter table number (if already seated);
endif
:Enter note, click "Confirm order & Go to payment";

|System|
:Re-validate everything on server: cart not empty (BR-06),\nquantity > 0 (BR-07), prices from DB, enough ingredients,\naddress required for delivery, scheduled time 07:00-21:30 and >= now + 30 min;
:Calculate item total, Aura points discount,\ndelivery fee (delivery only, free above free-ship threshold);
:In 1 transaction: create orders (PENDING; order_type = ONLINE / TAKEAWAY / DINE_IN,\nscheduled_at, table_number) + order_items + deduct redeemed points;
:Generate order code and VietQR (amount + content = order code);

|Customer|
:Scan VietQR, transfer money\nthen click "I have transferred";
note right
  SRS API-02/03: result comes from VnPay/SePay webhook.
  Current version: customer self-confirms - webhook will be integrated later.
end note

|System|
if (Payment recorded successfully\nand amount matches order (BR-09)?) then (yes)
  :payments = SUCCESS, orders = CONFIRMED;
  :Push order to barista queue (flow 2.3);
  :Earn points, create invoice, clear cart;
  |Customer|
  :View order status + invoice (UC14, UC15);
else (expired / failed)
  |System|
  :orders = CANCELLED, refund held points;
  |Customer|
  :Receive notification, can reorder;
endif
stop
@enduml
